---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Show traceability chain for an entity, or for every entity

Usage: specforge trace [OPTIONS] [ENTITY]

Arguments:
  [ENTITY]
          Entity ID to trace (omit to trace every entity)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          Path to the spec root directory
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: json or human
          
          [default: json]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
